@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:18080
@tenant = replace-with-local-tenant-public-id
@email = replace-with-user-email
@password = replace-with-user-password
@xsrf = replace-with-decoded-xsrf-cookie

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz

### CSRF cookie (guardar cookies y copiar XSRF-TOKEN decodificado a @xsrf)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sanctum/csrf-cookie
Origin: http://localhost:5173

### Login local
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Origin: http://localhost:5173
X-Everprop-Tenant: {{tenant}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Origin: http://localhost:5173
X-Everprop-Tenant: {{tenant}}

### Public projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/projects?per_page=10&sort=created_at&direction=desc
X-Everprop-Tenant: {{tenant}}

### Public properties
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/properties?status=AVAILABLE&per_page=10
X-Everprop-Tenant: {{tenant}}

### Negative: tenant selection in query is rejected
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/properties?tenant_id=1
X-Everprop-Tenant: {{tenant}}
